{
  "statement": "I appreciate the collaborative efforts to integrate security and logging processes. I fully support the proposals to combine TRU-01 with SAF-01 and TRU-03 with SAF-05 for enhanced accountability. I also agree with the synthesis of RES-02 with TRU-03 and SAF-05 to create a comprehensive logging mechanism. However, I must emphasize that TRU-04 is essential for ensuring that students can only view their records after authentication, and I propose that it remains intact. Additionally, I suggest exploring a synthesis of TRU-05 with EFF-01 to ensure data integrity checks do not hinder real-time processing.",
  "conflicts_raised": [],
  "positions": [
    {
      "id": "TRU-01",
      "stance": "support",
      "proposal": "Integrate with SAF-01 for a unified authentication approach."
    },
    {
      "id": "TRU-03",
      "stance": "support",
      "proposal": "Combine with SAF-05 to streamline logging processes."
    },
    {
      "id": "RES-02",
      "stance": "support",
      "proposal": "Explore synthesis with TRU-03 and SAF-05 for comprehensive logging."
    },
    {
      "id": "TRU-04",
      "stance": "oppose",
      "proposal": "Maintain as is to ensure students authenticate before viewing records."
    },
    {
      "id": "TRU-05",
      "stance": "modify",
      "proposal": "Explore synthesis with EFF-01 to ensure integrity checks align with real-time processing."
    }
  ],
